They used to come in the homes and rape young girls, women. The Ukrainian, who are also big antisemite, started to come and they take and steal. It-- it's-- it was not stealing. They used to come and take-- into the house, and take away things what they wanted. We were without protection, without nobody.

And the school stopped. Everything stopped. Suddenly, we were third-class citizen. We did not have no rights. Nobody care about us.

