The people were very generous. They took-- used to take off the wedding bands-- everything what they had from the gold, giving. They thought, in this way, we will satisfy the German, and they will let us to live longer. They will not kill us. So for-- to preserve the life, we were willing to give away everything, except to save the life. But unfortunately, that was not the story.

